Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.08,0:00:14.71,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真っ赤な線を描いたちっぽけな心の話
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.04,0:00:21.05,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,僕らの未来はどこに向かって光るの
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.55,0:00:28.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,続きの線を描いた　色づいてしまう度にまぶしい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.14,0:00:33.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,そんな心のリズムを繋ぎだす
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.02,0:00:40.99,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,かなしいかなしいかなしいかなしい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.82,0:00:47.70,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,うれしいうれしいうれしいうれしい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.40,0:00:54.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,２つの感情に揺さぶられては
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.09,0:01:02.04,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,まだ見ぬ指先を照らし出してくだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.34,0:01:09.22,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,このまま嘘でもいいから夢泳がせて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.22,0:01:14.92,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,かなしいかなしい今を探してく
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.11,0:01:22.53,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,僕らは見えない未来を信じてる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.54,0:01:28.40,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,だから悲しい悲しい今を探しては光った
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.41,0:01:29.56,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,引つかた
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.33,0:01:41.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,天氣放晴了真是太好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.04,0:01:43.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.25,0:01:46.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我還是第一次參加婚禮呢 好緊張
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.63,0:01:48.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉你的髮夾真可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.92,0:01:51.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嗎 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.17,0:01:53.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你把頭髮放下來也很好看呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.13,0:01:55.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼會變成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.85,0:01:58.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉 打擾你們了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.31,0:02:01.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,話說 仁阪 你不先去家裡真的好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.31,0:02:03.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這可是你哥哥的婚禮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.48,0:02:08.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沒事 反正去了也是被親戚們纏著問這問那麻煩死了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.69,0:02:11.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,麻煩...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.40,0:02:14.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,作為弟弟你就沒有什麼感想嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.99,0:02:18.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,並沒有 不過 安心了不少
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.53,0:02:19.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,安心?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.04,0:02:22.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的父母是因為政府通知而結婚的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.08,0:02:25.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,總是說對方是自己的命定之人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.12,0:02:27.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,總說自己現在十分幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.00,0:02:32.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那麼 如果他們的孩子也能通過政府通知結婚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.88,0:02:36.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,讓他們看到自己幸福的樣子也算是盡孝了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.60,0:02:39.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以 哥哥結婚了我覺得真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.68,0:02:42.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,政府通知的對象
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.36,0:03:00.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我 喜歡莉莉奈嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.08,0:03:05.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我喜歡的人是高崎同學
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.00,0:03:07.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小學五年級的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.46,0:03:10.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我看到了她的那個笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.63,0:03:13.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我覺得她就是我的命定之人 我很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.67,0:03:16.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以 我就喜歡上她了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.30,0:03:17.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.72,0:03:21.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,美咲她有著想要保護的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.18,0:03:23.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,即使撒謊也在所不惜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.10,0:03:28.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學的謊言 到底是什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.02,0:03:32.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今天真是恭喜了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.73,0:03:36.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉 請問你們四位是政府通知的情侶嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.16,0:03:42.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這傢伙和那邊的長頭髮女孩是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.62,0:03:45.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是這樣啊 真是不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.12,0:03:49.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是這裡會場宣傳的負責人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.17,0:03:54.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,希望拜託兩位小姐來做我們宣傳冊的模特
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.84,0:03:58.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,宣傳冊的模特？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.68,0:04:00.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我們還只是高中生而已
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.01,0:04:03.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是高中生才好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.68,0:04:08.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我們的宣傳對象就是高中期間要結婚的政府通知情侶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.98,0:04:11.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,希望讓兩位可愛的小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.44,0:04:15.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以婚紗造型來做我們的婚禮模特
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.74,0:04:19.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,婚 婚紗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.97,0:04:22.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你興奮什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.57,0:04:23.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因為...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.12,0:04:25.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你覺得怎麼樣 美咲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.83,0:04:30.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就試試吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.79,0:04:33.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,挺好的 就當是提前演練了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.84,0:04:36.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這種事還可以提前演練的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.84,0:04:38.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.59,0:04:41.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可以倒是可以
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.30,0:04:44.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,明白了 我們參加
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.85,0:04:45.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.10,0:04:47.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.23,0:04:53.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那麼 改天我們會通知攝影時間
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.61,0:04:56.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能拜託你們在這裡寫下你們的聯絡方式嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.69,0:04:57.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.86,0:05:01.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你們二位穿婚紗一定會很漂亮的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.36,0:05:05.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也可以帶上你們的政府通知對像來參觀哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.87,0:05:07.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.16,0:05:09.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,當然了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.11,0:05:42.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,讓各位久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.61,0:05:45.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有請新郎新娘入場
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.64,0:05:50.68,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恭喜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.93,0:05:51.94,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真漂亮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.73,0:05:57.86,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.74,0:05:47.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我們以掌聲觀迎他們
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.23,0:06:19.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,遙一先生 真理惠小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.19,0:06:22.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,先在這裡恭喜二位了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.03,0:06:25.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,請允許我自我介紹
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.57,0:06:30.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是負責他們二位的 厚勞省的伊藤
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.25,0:06:35.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今天十分榮幸擔任此次婚禮的主持人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.75,0:06:38.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,請各位多多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.46,0:06:43.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,讓這兩位命中注定之人走在一起的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.80,0:06:45.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是四年前的七月政府通知的到來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.51,0:06:49.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,新郎遙一先生當時是大學一年級學生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.22,0:06:53.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每天都認真地學習 積極地參加社團活動
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.18,0:06:54.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等到我結婚的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.27,0:06:58.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的戀愛經歷也會被拍成這種短片嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.69,0:07:02.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是令人難為情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.36,0:07:08.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果我和莉莉奈結婚了的話
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.41,0:07:11.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那件事也會就這樣隨風消逝嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.25,0:07:17.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真棒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.96,0:07:20.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊 真的很美好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.21,0:07:22.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉你很高興呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.84,0:07:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嗎 能看出來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.01,0:07:28.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的眼睛在閃閃發光呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.06,0:07:35.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對了 前段時間 班上的同學跟我搭話了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.69,0:07:38.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雖然內容只是普通的話題
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.48,0:07:40.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,班上的同學嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.23,0:07:44.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,從前從沒發生過這種事 我也很驚訝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.57,0:07:46.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然後有紗說
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.53,0:07:49.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是之前那個戴眼鏡的女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.95,0:07:53.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她說我看起來比以前溫柔了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.74,0:07:55.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我自己並沒有感到有什麼不同
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.62,0:08:00.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我覺得這些都是因為由佳吏美咲
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:04.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因為美咲和我成為了朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.22,0:08:10.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我第一次交到了朋友 真的很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.35,0:08:15.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然後 所以 那個
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.23,0:08:19.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.94,0:08:21.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.90,0:08:28.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也很高興能和莉莉成為朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.82,0:08:31.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,笨拙 誠實 不會撒謊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.16,0:08:34.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和你在一起真的很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.83,0:08:36.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真想和你永遠做朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.70,0:08:38.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.71,0:08:43.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要叫我來參加你的婚禮哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.55,0:08:56.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這樣耀眼幸福的模樣最適合你了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.31,0:09:01.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可以的話能讓我作為你的朋友代表上去致辭嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.60,0:09:02.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,開玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.94,0:09:07.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好期待啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.44,0:09:09.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,婚禮真美好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.87,0:09:21.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 看向這邊 要拍了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.84,0:09:28.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,感謝各位的配合
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:33.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我們拍攝的照片各位可以自行下單郵寄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.43,0:09:35.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,請務必看看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.60,0:09:39.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接下來請新娘拋捧花
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.31,0:09:44.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,各位請走下台階 站到這邊這條線的外側
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.86,0:09:50.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.99,0:09:53.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我好像把手機落在桌子上了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.03,0:09:54.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.07,0:09:56.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我去取一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.83,0:09:57.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.09,0:10:09.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.55,0:10:16.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高 高崎同學
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.47,0:10:19.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怎麼了 沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.35,0:10:22.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 我沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.02,0:10:26.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只是被婚禮感動了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.19,0:10:29.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的嗎 看起來不像是那樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.40,0:10:34.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.57,0:10:38.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉 我撒謊了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.70,0:10:40.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.25,0:10:44.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不能說 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.25,0:10:48.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,各位 新娘已經做好拋捧花的準備了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.09,0:10:51.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你們也做好心理準備了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.67,0:10:56.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有我能做的事嗎 什麼都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.26,0:10:57.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我什麼都可以做的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.05,0:11:03.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果我 我能做點什麼事就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.60,0:11:07.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下一個獲得幸福的人會是誰呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.85,0:11:11.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,準備好了嗎 數一二三就拋了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.44,0:11:13.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,...也好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.41,0:11:16.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.70,0:11:17.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就算是謊也好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.87,0:11:19.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,二
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.45,0:11:22.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,說你喜歡我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.25,0:11:23.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,三
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.00,0:11:32.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.88,0:11:35.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,讓我們為她送上熱烈的掌聲
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.84,0:12:16.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉 我又做了這樣卑鄙的事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.59,0:12:17.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼會
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.18,0:12:20.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我已經沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.97,0:12:23.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.93,0:12:30.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那一瞬間的心情毫無虛偽 但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.98,0:12:36.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,回家的路上我很後悔自己做了這麼輕率的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.57,0:12:41.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學帶著一臉勉強的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.41,0:12:45.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和第一次接吻的那晚的樣子完全不一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.33,0:12:49.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,現在的距離 比曾經在教室裡看著她的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.71,0:12:51.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拉近了那麼多
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.21,0:12:53.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有時我又覺得我們相隔得十分遙遠
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.67,0:12:58.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這些話的確不該對你這個不打算選擇美咲的人說
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.09,0:13:05.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我能為高崎同學做些什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.18,0:13:12.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也許最終也只會將她傷得更深
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.61,0:13:21.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由佳吏 由佳吏
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.86,0:13:24.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你會去溫泉的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.62,0:13:29.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真田家
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.83,0:13:30.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,根島家
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.25,0:13:33.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,共同溫泉旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.17,0:13:37.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 要高興地去玩哦 小楓
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.75,0:13:39.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,當然了 智裡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.67,0:13:42.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,媽媽 溫泉是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.13,0:13:43.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是極樂淨土哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.14,0:13:46.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,極樂經(淨)圖(土)是什麼呀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.18,0:13:48.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是經圖 是淨土
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.06,0:13:50.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你聽說了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.02,0:13:58.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.57,0:14:03.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真田家有一個親戚在這裡經營著一家溫泉旅館
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.32,0:14:07.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因為突然有人取消預約了 邀請我們了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.03,0:14:09.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就算你這麼說也...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.20,0:14:11.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了 行李就交給爸爸我們帶去旅館
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.41,0:14:14.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你去做莉莉奈的護花使者吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.60,0:14:29.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由佳吏 當心腳下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.77,0:14:33.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我這哪算什麼護花使者啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.73,0:14:36.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.98,0:14:41.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,謝 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.53,0:14:44.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 你小心點
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.37,0:14:53.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,現在想這些也沒什麼用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.04,0:14:59.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我們去那邊看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.48,0:15:19.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要先掰開 掰開然後放涼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.19,0:15:20.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我 我做不到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.33,0:15:32.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由佳吏真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.33,0:15:38.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.33,0:15:43.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈 你比剛認識的時候更愛笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.26,0:15:47.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,美咲也這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.43,0:15:50.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.77,0:15:55.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我們回旅館吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.89,0:15:56.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.15,0:16:03.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,來了來了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.32,0:16:07.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,給 這是你和莉莉奈的房間鑰匙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.66,0:16:12.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你們倆的行李已經放到房間裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.04,0:16:16.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被耍了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.08,0:16:19.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看起來是兩人間呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.75,0:16:24.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這裡睡覺的時候也要睡一張床嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.38,0:16:28.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個 我沒關係的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.13,0:16:30.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雖然我自己這麼說可能有點奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.26,0:16:34.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是時候 我沒有什麼非分之想 那個
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.56,0:16:37.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,總之我什麼也不會也做的 你要相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.90,0:16:44.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.65,0:16:48.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那時是我說的先暫時休戰
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.86,0:16:51.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因為發生了很多事 我都快忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.87,0:16:52.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,現在我已經不介意了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.58,0:16:55.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,溫泉旅行開心玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.22,0:17:11.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由佳吏 由佳吏
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.26,0:17:14.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這邊的都是露天溫泉哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.47,0:17:17.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,當然是有分男女的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.68,0:17:20.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的很棒哦 由佳吏你也去試試吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.23,0:17:22.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的 我會去的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.15,0:17:26.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是和智裡還有小絆三個人一起去的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.32,0:17:28.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.69,0:17:32.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我們家就只有我和莉莉奈是女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.11,0:17:35.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很久沒有和別人一起開開心心地泡溫泉了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.79,0:17:40.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以 真的很感謝你們 由佳吏
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.41,0:17:44.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個我才是要謝謝你們
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.54,0:17:48.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有點害羞啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.43,0:17:53.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,比想像中還要豪華啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.59,0:17:56.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能包下這麼大的地方真的好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.06,0:18:06.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,復活了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.16,0:18:24.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這個隔板的對面就是女湯了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.17,0:18:26.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好燙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.84,0:18:28.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是莉莉奈嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.84,0:18:30.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由佳吏嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.67,0:18:34.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能把這個露天溫泉包下來真的好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.18,0:18:36.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我這邊是木製的浴池
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.14,0:18:38.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你那邊是怎樣的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.56,0:18:40.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我這邊是石製的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.77,0:18:41.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.52,0:18:50.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由佳吏 你那邊沒人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.61,0:18:51.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沒人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.32,0:18:53.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只有我一個
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.70,0:19:02.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,之前關於五十嵐說的那件事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.91,0:19:07.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她所說的命運之人 由佳吏怎麼想
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.21,0:19:09.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼想？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.30,0:19:11.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她是話裡有話吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.42,0:19:15.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還是說 你也覺得緣分真的是天注定呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.97,0:19:22.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,命運嗎 這種事我也不太明白
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.64,0:19:25.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊 太不科學了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.60,0:19:27.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她為什麼要說那種話呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.23,0:19:29.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是仔細想想的話
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.02,0:19:33.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也是為了能和高崎同學上同一所高中才努力學習
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.86,0:19:35.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以才進入了現在的高中
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.53,0:19:38.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,為了有一點點能配得上她
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.70,0:19:40.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也開始在意自己的外表
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.33,0:19:44.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因為有高崎同學在 去上學都成為了一件開心的事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.12,0:19:46.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以 對小學的我來說
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.46,0:19:50.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那時的高崎同學是我的命運之人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.42,0:19:53.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,或者說是命運的女神吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.72,0:19:58.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,命運的女神
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.89,0:20:00.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我只是比喻 比喻而已
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.01,0:20:02.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因為之前從來沒有和她說過話
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.60,0:20:05.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她對我來說就像女神一樣遙不可及
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.77,0:20:15.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,之所以有現在的由佳吏 都是因為有美咲吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.40,0:20:19.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這不是由佳吏嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.24,0:20:23.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你一個人嗎 我剛剛好像聽見有人在說話
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.12,0:20:25.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.41,0:20:27.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哎呀 能那樣在溫泉裡和你相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.46,0:20:31.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,感覺就像有了個兒子一樣 好高興啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.04,0:20:36.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對了 由佳吏 你看到房間裡的傳單了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.67,0:20:40.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那上面有你喜歡的前方後圓墳吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:42.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是雙方中圓墳啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.06,0:20:53.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好像睡不著啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.28,0:21:02.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼了 怎麼了 怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.41,0:21:05.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由佳吏 能和你談談嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.24,0:21:07.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.54,0:21:12.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個 以前我一直有句話想告訴你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.92,0:21:14.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.50,0:21:16.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我 我們先開燈了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.80,0:21:19.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太黑了有點那個 怎麼說 就是那個
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.38,0:21:20.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要開燈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.05,0:21:26.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,開燈了的話 我可能就害羞得說不出話來了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.27,0:21:28.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.52,0:21:33.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今天很開心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.98,0:21:35.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不怎麼來溫泉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.77,0:21:36.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,偶爾來一次也很棒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.90,0:21:41.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,特別是天氣冷的時候來真的特別舒服 很溫暖
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.32,0:21:47.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下次也邀請高崎同學和仁阪來泡溫泉怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.62,0:21:51.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就像之前我們去露營的時候也很開心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.08,0:21:53.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且之後天氣也漸漸變冷了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.33,0:21:54.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我說啊 由佳吏
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.08,0:21:56.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我一直在想
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.80,0:22:04.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我覺得由佳吏你應該選擇美咲
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.18,0:22:26.96,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,さっきの言葉はまだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.96,0:22:29.49,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,I can't say I want to say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.49,0:22:31.57,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,言えないままでしまってる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.57,0:22:33.85,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,I always lie
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.85,0:22:36.14,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,星の瞬きほど早く
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.14,0:22:38.57,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,願い事するひまも無く
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.57,0:22:40.71,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,短い夏が終わってく
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.71,0:22:43.53,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,I can't say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.53,0:22:46.42,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Heart beat sound
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.42,0:22:52.42,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,気づかないでいてね高鳴る鼓動
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.42,0:22:56.38,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Can't keep it to myself
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.38,0:22:59.23,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自然にこぼれたはにかむ顔が
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.23,0:23:05.56,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,隠せないメッセージ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.56,0:23:07.39,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,I know why I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.39,0:23:09.85,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,未来を重ねた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.85,0:23:14.55,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,二人の温もりが ここに残ってる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.55,0:23:16.55,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,ありふれた日々に
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.55,0:23:19.15,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,はじまりのキスを
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.15,0:23:34.70,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,ひとりの夜は 君の夢を見てた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.02,0:23:40.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,政府通知 姻緣法 被保證的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.90,0:23:42.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的真心是...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.90,0:23:45.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下集 戀愛與謊言
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.08,0:00:14.71,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}畫下等待的長線 這是心中小小的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.04,0:00:21.05,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}我們的未來 到底會走向何方呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.55,0:00:28.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}畫下連續的長線 接下來的旅途必定也耀眼奪目吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.14,0:00:33.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}就這樣 連接上心的旋律
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.02,0:00:40.99,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}悲傷 悲傷 悲傷和悲傷
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.82,0:00:47.70,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}快樂 快樂 快樂和快樂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.40,0:00:54.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}把兩份感傷的心疊放在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.09,0:01:02.04,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}看不清的未來裡誰才是該出場的配角
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.34,0:01:09.22,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}就這樣下去 即使是謊言也讓我把這美夢做完吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.22,0:01:14.92,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}悲傷地 悲傷地 現在就去尋找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.11,0:01:22.53,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}我們相信著看不見的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.54,0:01:28.40,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}悲傷地 悲傷地 去尋找著
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.41,0:01:29.56,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}現在就去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.18,0:22:26.96,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,剛才想說的話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.49,0:22:31.57,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還沒能說出口
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.85,0:22:36.14,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,時間轉瞬即逝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.14,0:22:38.57,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,無暇許下心願
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.57,0:22:40.71,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,短暫夏日就此結束
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.42,0:22:52.42,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,別讓他發現 心聲難以克制
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.38,0:22:59.23,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自然流露的靦腆表情
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.23,0:23:05.56,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,掩藏不住心意
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.39,0:23:09.85,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,兩人的溫度
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.85,0:23:14.55,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,歷經歲月 停留在此
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.55,0:23:16.55,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在平淡的日子裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.55,0:23:19.15,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,時常回想起我們第一次的吻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.15,0:23:34.70,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,孤獨的夜裡 在夢中與你相會
